---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Portfolio
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero page-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A portfolio of questions & discoveries</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Finding the <em>story</em><br>in the data<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-name">Hi, I'm {{ site.name }}. <span>{{ site.role }}.</span></p>
    <p class="hero-description">{{ site.intro }}</p>
    <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="#selected-work">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">A little about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="figure-label"><span>FIG. 01</span><span>FROM COMPLEXITY TO CLARITY</span></div>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 440 320" class="hero-chart"><defs><pattern id="dot-grid" width="22" height="22" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="#c9d1d6"/></pattern></defs><rect width="440" height="300" fill="url(#dot-grid)"/><path d="M28 269H411M28 269V23" stroke="#a7b3bb" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M29 239C91 240 104 198 160 189S224 165 255 123S327 131 408 44" fill="none" stroke="#446889" stroke-width="2"/><g fill="#8ea6ba"><circle cx="50" cy="236" r="5"/><circle cx="64" cy="259" r="3"/><circle cx="92" cy="213" r="4"/><circle cx="107" cy="231" r="3"/><circle cx="117" cy="186" r="5"/><circle cx="139" cy="217" r="3"/><circle cx="159" cy="174" r="4"/><circle cx="181" cy="200" r="4"/><circle cx="191" cy="168" r="3"/><circle cx="204" cy="142" r="4"/><circle cx="238" cy="160" r="4"/><circle cx="251" cy="109" r="3"/><circle cx="275" cy="131" r="4"/><circle cx="310" cy="101" r="4"/><circle cx="336" cy="125" r="3"/><circle cx="355" cy="73" r="4"/><circle cx="378" cy="91" r="3"/><circle cx="397" cy="49" r="4"/></g><circle cx="255" cy="123" r="11" fill="#f8f9f6" stroke="#446889" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="255" cy="123" r="4" fill="#446889"/><path d="M263 114L289 69H340" stroke="#7b8d9c" fill="none"/><text x="293" y="60" fill="#446889" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-style="italic" font-size="19">the insight</text><text x="29" y="296" class="svg-mono">QUESTIONS</text><text x="324" y="296" class="svg-mono">UNDERSTANDING →</text></svg>
    <p>Good analysis makes the next step clearer.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="expertise-strip page-shell"><span class="strip-label">THE WORK, IN A FEW WORDS</span><span>Analysis</span><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span>Visualization</span><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span>Decision-making</span></div>
<section id="selected-work" class="work-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2 id="work-title">A few questions I've explored.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}">All projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <p class="section-note">A preview of the portfolio structure. Replace these example projects with your own work.</p>
  <div class="project-grid">
  {% for project in collections.projects | featured | limit(3) %}{% set featuredCard = loop.first %}{% include 'components/project-card.njk' %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="about-band" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="page-shell about-band-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / BEHIND THE ANALYSIS</p><h2 id="about-title">Curious by nature.<br><em>Analytical</em> by approach.</h2></div><div><p>A space for the person behind the projects: your background, the problems you care about, and the way you approach your work.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/credentials/' | url }}">Education & credentials <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="writing-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="writing-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / NOTES & OBSERVATIONS</p><h2 id="writing-title">Thinking out loud.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/writing/' | url }}">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="writing-list">{% for post in collections.posts | limit(2) %}<article class="writing-row"><span class="writing-index">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span><div><div class="card-kicker">{{ post.data.category }}{% if post.data.example %}<span class="sample-label">Sample article</span>{% endif %}</div><h3><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p></div><span class="reading-time">{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min read</span></article>{% endfor %}</div>
</section>
<section class="contact-band page-shell" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">HAVE AN INTERESTING QUESTION?</p><h2 id="contact-title">Let's connect the dots.</h2></div><a class="button" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
